# Force HTTPS: instruct browsers to only ever connect over TLS (mirrors the
# marketing site). The HTTP→HTTPS redirect itself is the Cloudflare zone
# "Always Use HTTPS" setting.
#
# Content-Security-Policy (2026-10-12) — ENFORCED. What the app really reaches
# for, and nothing else:
#   • script-src: its own bundle; the one inline script in index.html (the
#     pre-paint theme), allowed by its hash — change that script and the hash
#     must change with it (`npm run test:theme` checks); Google's sign-in
#     script (the SDK loads accounts.google.com/gsi/client on demand).
#     No 'unsafe-inline' and no 'unsafe-eval'.
#   • style-src 'unsafe-inline': React style attributes, everywhere.
#   • connect-src: Supabase (API, auth, storage, realtime), the suite
#     changelog, the R2 hosted-files Worker (Save to cloud uploads and
#     playback checks), Google sign-in.
#   • media-src: recordings play from blob: URLs made on this device, and a
#     cloud recording streams from a signed Supabase Storage or R2 link.
#   • worker-src 'self' blob:: the service worker, and the frame clock that
#     keeps screen recordings moving in a hidden tab (a blob: worker).
#   • img-src https:: avatars come from wherever the sign-in provider keeps them.
#   • No Cloudflare Web Analytics. Cloudflare's zone-level automatic setup
#     injects its beacon (static.cloudflareinsights.com) into the live HTML;
#     this policy refuses it. Turn the injection off for this host in
#     Cloudflare (Web Analytics site rules).
# The dev server serves the same policy Report-Only (vite.config.ts, cspDev()).
#
# Hardening. Nothing in the suite frames this app, so refusing to be framed
# elsewhere costs nothing and closes off click-jacking. No Permissions-Policy:
# the app needs the microphone, the camera and screen capture.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-cqJGi3RzbuMGACmZGmUdZFsgsx++Q4YLdV3za+Z8pss=' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/style; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' data: blob: https://rygfxgalojojppxmhddo.supabase.co wss://rygfxgalojojppxmhddo.supabase.co https://changelog.unisim.co.uk https://unisim-hosted-files.inbox-12f.workers.dev https://accounts.google.com/gsi/; media-src 'self' blob: data: https://rygfxgalojojppxmhddo.supabase.co https://unisim-hosted-files.inbox-12f.workers.dev; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'
